autoware-model-downloader-2-1-0 (2.1.0-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Download into $HOME/autoware_data/ml_models by default, the data_path
    Autoware 2.1.0's launch files default to. 1.9.0 moved it there from
    $HOME/autoware_data, where this script kept writing, so launches with
    no data_path:= found no models.
  * Models found in $HOME/autoware_data for this version stop the run with
    the command that moves them, instead of downloading them again.

 -- Jerry Lin <jerry73204@gmail.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800

